{"slug":"research/team/societal-impacts","main":"<div data-page-top-spacer=\"condensed\" class=\"\"><section class=\"ZSMdoa_root\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_container\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\"><h1 class=\"LOCOdG_text\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"LOCOdG_lead\"><button type=\"button\" data-lead-control=\"true\" class=\"v9lDbq_button\">The Societal Impacts team<span class=\"v9lDbq_mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"_6xvBMG_mark v9lDbq_markImage\" style=\"mask-image: url(&quot;/sites/anthropic/sanity/23cca33c21eddb8f7ec75d5bf606c1f5a2146e00-1152x1088.webp&quot;); mask-size: 1800% 1700%; mask-position: 23.5294% 37.5%;\"></span></span></button></span> <span class=\"LOCOdG_statement\">studies how AI affects people, both individually and collectively. We measure Claude’s effect on how people think, work, and relate to one another, and use what we learn to improve our models and products.</span></h1></div></section><section class=\"ZSMdoa_root ZSMdoa_flushBottom ZSMdoa_flushTop\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_container iNfPUa_mediaFullWidth\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\"><div style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><figure><div class=\"TSxPAa_e-videoEmbed\"><div class=\"_BfwWW_cover\"><img alt=\"Video thumbnail\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/a312bf766c7c3159ca72.webp\"><button aria-label=\"Play video\" data-component=\"Button\" data-variant=\"tertiary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-large f9ZZrG_icon-format-icon-only _BfwWW_playButton\"><span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg class=\"lqbdHG_icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.59961 3.6418C3.59986 2.58403 4.76149 1.93696 5.66066 2.49394L14.303 7.85268C15.1543 8.38061 15.1542 9.61864 14.303 10.1466L5.66066 15.5054C4.8175 16.0278 3.74356 15.4919 3.61279 14.5509L3.59961 14.3575V3.6418ZM5.18692 3.25947C4.88726 3.07384 4.49987 3.28934 4.49962 3.6418V14.3575L4.50401 14.4226C4.54786 14.736 4.90598 14.914 5.18692 14.7399L13.8284 9.38199C14.1121 9.20596 14.1122 8.79328 13.8284 8.61734L5.18692 3.25947Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"ZSMdoa_root\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_container\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_standard Bo9kyq_flow-row NEQLZG_grid\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Standard\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_m-full Bo9kyq_t-span-5 Bo9kyq_d-span-4 NEQLZG_metadata\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Item\"><div style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><dl class=\"kpV0Dq_articleMeta\"><div class=\"kpV0Dq_articleMetaItem\"><dt>Anthropic Insights dataset</dt><dd><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Anthropic/enabling-independent-research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"kpV0Dq_articleMetaItemLink\"><span>Visit</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.4999 2.00017C11.776 2.00017 11.9999 2.22403 11.9999 2.50017V9.5002C11.9998 9.7762 11.7759 10.0002 11.4999 10.0002C11.2239 10.0001 11 9.7762 10.9999 9.5002V3.7072L2.85338 11.8537C2.6581 12.0488 2.34155 12.0489 2.14635 11.8537C1.95116 11.6585 1.95127 11.3419 2.14635 11.1467L10.2928 3.00017H4.49986C4.22387 3.00006 3.99995 2.77617 3.99986 2.50017C3.99986 2.22409 4.22381 2.00028 4.49986 2.00017H11.4999Z\"></path></svg></a></dd></div></dl></div></div><div class=\"Bo9kyq_m-full Bo9kyq_t-span-7 Bo9kyq_t-start-6 Bo9kyq_d-span-8 Bo9kyq_d-start-5 NEQLZG_textCell\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Item\"><div class=\"NEQLZG_texts\"><div class=\"NEQLZG_text js-stagger-item\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\" data-animated=\"true\"><h3 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 NEQLZG_heading\" data-component=\"Headline\">Measuring real-world impact</h3><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-3\" data-component=\"Body\">How does AI affect people’s wellbeing, reasoning, and relationships? Our researchers study how people interact with Claude at scale, and interview them directly about their experience. We publish what we learn, and work to support outside researchers studying these questions.</p></div><div class=\"NEQLZG_text js-stagger-item\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\" data-animated=\"true\"><h3 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 NEQLZG_heading\" data-component=\"Headline\">Improving our models and products</h3><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-3\" data-component=\"Body\">Our research identifies ways Claude can serve people better. We act on what we learn by integrating these findings into changes to Claude’s behavior, new evaluations, and product improvements.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"ZSMdoa_root\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_inset-frame\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_hero-carousel _5NNTzG_unthemed _5NNTzG_inset\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 0;\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-wrapper\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_embla-viewport\"><ul class=\"_5NNTzG_embla-container\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"><li class=\"_5NNTzG_embla-slide\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"><a class=\"_5NNTzG_slide-link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"/features/81k-interviews\"><img alt=\"What 81,000 people want from AI\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"1407\" height=\"793\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/1af4e6dfb604671ad20e.webp\"></a></li><li class=\"_5NNTzG_embla-slide\"><a class=\"_5NNTzG_slide-link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"/research/enabling-independent-research\"><img alt=\"Enabling independent research on how people use Claude\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"1407\" height=\"793\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/8a35824be1c5bbd2a4d4.webp\"></a></li><li class=\"_5NNTzG_embla-slide\"><a class=\"_5NNTzG_slide-link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"/research/measuring-agent-autonomy\"><img alt=\"Measuring AI agent autonomy in practice\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"1407\" height=\"793\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/7baab293a4f0387c104f.webp\"></a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-slides\"><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to What 81,000 people want from AI\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_7kllaanpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/economics\">Economics</a></p><time class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-date\">Mar 18, 2026</time></header><a class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-link\" href=\"/features/81k-interviews\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-title\" data-component=\"Headline\">What 81,000 people want from AI</h2></a><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-description\" data-component=\"Body\">We invited Claude.ai users to share how they use AI, what they dream it could make possible, and what they fear it might do. Nearly 81,000 people participated—the largest and most multilingual qualitative study of its kind. Here's what we found.</p><a href=\"/features/81k-interviews\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-secondary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing _5NNTzG_carousel-info-cta\">Read more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg class=\"lqbdHG_icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><path d=\"M4.14585 9.87492L14.4584 9.87492L9.60419 5.04158L10.5 4.14575L16.8542 10.4999L10.5 16.8541L9.60419 15.9583L14.4584 11.1249L4.14585 11.1249L4.14585 9.87492Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\" data-inactive=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to Enabling independent research on how people use Claude\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_7kplaanpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/societal-impacts\">Societal Impacts</a></p><time class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-date\">Aug 26, 2026</time></header><a class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-link\" href=\"/research/enabling-independent-research\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-title\" data-component=\"Headline\">Enabling independent research on how people use Claude</h2></a><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-description\" data-component=\"Body\">We ran a pilot giving external researchers access to aggregate, real-world Claude usage data. In this post, we share high-level results and what we learned running this pilot.</p><a href=\"/research/enabling-independent-research\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-secondary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing _5NNTzG_carousel-info-cta\">Read more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg class=\"lqbdHG_icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><path d=\"M4.14585 9.87492L14.4584 9.87492L9.60419 5.04158L10.5 4.14575L16.8542 10.4999L10.5 16.8541L9.60419 15.9583L14.4584 11.1249L4.14585 11.1249L4.14585 9.87492Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\" data-inactive=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to Measuring AI agent autonomy in practice\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_7ktlaanpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/societal-impacts\">Societal Impacts</a></p><time class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-date\">Feb 18, 2026</time></header><a class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-link\" href=\"/research/measuring-agent-autonomy\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-title\" data-component=\"Headline\">Measuring AI agent autonomy in practice</h2></a><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-description\" data-component=\"Body\">We analyzed millions of human-agent interactions across both Claude Code and our public API using our privacy-preserving tool, to ask: How much autonomy do people grant agents? How does that change as people gain experience? Which domains are agents operating in? And are the actions taken by agents risky?</p><a href=\"/research/measuring-agent-autonomy\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-secondary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing _5NNTzG_carousel-info-cta\">Read more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg class=\"lqbdHG_icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><path d=\"M4.14585 9.87492L14.4584 9.87492L9.60419 5.04158L10.5 4.14575L16.8542 10.4999L10.5 16.8541L9.60419 15.9583L14.4584 11.1249L4.14585 11.1249L4.14585 9.87492Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div role=\"group\" class=\"n4MhcW_carousel-controls _5NNTzG_carousel-info-controls\" aria-label=\"Carousel controls\"><button aria-label=\"Previous slide\" data-component=\"Button\" data-variant=\"tertiary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-icon-only\"><span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8.14648 4.64648C8.34176 4.45136 8.6583 4.45127 8.85352 4.64648C9.04868 4.8417 9.04862 5.15826 8.85352 5.35352L4.70703 9.50001H16.5C16.7761 9.50001 17 9.72387 17 10C16.9999 10.2761 16.7761 10.5 16.5 10.5H4.70703L8.85352 14.6465C9.04863 14.8418 9.04873 15.1583 8.85352 15.3535C8.6583 15.5487 8.34174 15.5486 8.14648 15.3535L3.14648 10.3535C3.05274 10.2598 3.00003 10.1326 3 10C3 9.90061 3.02967 9.80418 3.08398 9.72267L3.14648 9.64649L8.14648 4.64648Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"n4MhcW_carousel-controls-pagin